{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret biolab run by a decaying utopian regime. A failed experiment. A nightmare set free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak, hunt, and evolve as you escape a brutal research facility in this  reverse horror action roguelike. Mutate with every run, shaping your own perfect monstrosity. Will you outsmart your captors \u2014 or reduce them to meat?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to Expect (So Far)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth or Slaughter</strong> \u2013 Skulk in the shadows or turn the halls into a slaughterhouse. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Mutation</strong> \u2013 Evolve grotesque new abilities on every run, warping your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Escapes</strong> \u2013 No two attempts are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the Horror</strong> \u2013 Piece together the dark secrets of the facility\u2026 if you survive long enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And Then There Are the Cats</strong> \u2013 Mysterious, indifferent\u2026 possibly plotting something. We\u2019re not sure yet.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560630?t=1771839534","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560630?t=1771839534","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560630/a6f6316998f101d1754ec97168b8591f068f12d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771839534","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560630/a6f6316998f101d1754ec97168b8591f068f12d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771839534","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Players take on the role of a monster with the ability to kill humans, resulting in pixelated yet semi-realistic gore. Blood and body parts are visibly scattered upon impact, and the player can consume flesh from fallen victims. The game features a retro-style graphics aesthetic, with intentionally pixelated visuals, but the depictions of violence and gore may still be disturbing to some players."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret biolab run by a decaying utopian regime. A failed experiment. A nightmare set free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak, hunt, and evolve as you escape a brutal research facility in this  reverse horror action roguelike. Mutate with every run, shaping your own perfect monstrosity. Will you outsmart your captors \u2014 or reduce them to meat?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to Expect (So Far)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth or Slaughter</strong> \u2013 Skulk in the shadows or turn the halls into a slaughterhouse. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Mutation</strong> \u2013 Evolve grotesque new abilities on every run, warping your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Escapes</strong> \u2013 No two attempts are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the Horror</strong> \u2013 Piece together the dark secrets of the facility\u2026 if you survive long enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And Then There Are the Cats</strong> \u2013 Mysterious, indifferent\u2026 possibly plotting something. We\u2019re not sure yet.</p>","developers":["Neon Cocoa"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560630/26520d111fbd5407938958de3d1967172becb33b/header.jpg?t=1771839534","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3560630/1881145956/2fb77b87959410f7e9b0fc512e8fc36fc7ef8038/1750840662/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749933085","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_t